the melee arena:
the melee arena is a sort of event in which players can participate after paying a small fee. every time a player winds in the melee arena, his victory count increases by one. when the victory count reaches to ten, the player is eligible to receive one of the arena gifts, which are some extremely valuable items of the game.
the use of offencive spells in the melee arena is not allowed. this means that you cannot use any of the wand spells that are offencive in nature. however defencive spells are fair game, and are often used in order to gain the edge over other players.
melee weapons are of course used in the melee arena. the most common of them is the tm sword. the use of any gun, laser, or projectiles is not allowed.
to join the melee arena, you must type /participate in the chat box, or press the alt and the m key at the same time. after doing one of these you will be transported to the waiting area, where you must wait for the fight to start. as soon as the fighting begins you are free to kill whoever you want. you can either try to kill as many players as you want or hide or run away until the playercount lessens a little.
